{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me think about this puzzle more carefully. The key clues:\n- An award created in the 2000s\n- A book contender for this award, translated into 25+ languages\n- In the 2010s, the year this book was published, another book (released the preceding year) won this award\n- The prize-winning author was born in the city where the first book's author grew up\n\nThe International Booker Prize was reconfigured in 2016. Let me also consider the Jan Michalski Prize (created 2010), the Folio Prize (created 2014), and the Man Booker International Prize. Let me search more specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jan Michalski Prize winners 2010s literature\", \"Folio Prize winners 2010s\", \"Man Booker International Prize winners 2010s shortlist\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_33e52fccacf847abb76b2776","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"book translated into over 25 languages shortlisted international prize 2010s\", \"novel translated 30 languages contender international literary award 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_939e62eff289406d9a4e5cb7","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789472800,"id":"chatcmpl-92938b04-7cce-930f-948c-9439448572e7","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":9460,"completion_tokens":235,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":9695,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}